{"id":"c5534a58db9ff355","group":"93","path":"93/93-ex-subdirectly-irred.md","title":"Two-Element Boolean Algebra Is Subdirectly Irreducible","display":"Two-Element Boolean Algebra Is Subdirectly Irreducible","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ex-subdirectly-irred","aliases":["93-ex-subdirectly-irred"],"display":"Two-Element Boolean Algebra Is Subdirectly Irreducible","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-fact-boolean-2]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ex-subdirectly-irred"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ex-subdirectly-irred</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Two-Element Boolean Algebra Is Subdirectly Irreducible"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2431dc0f64e0f95\" href=\"?note=e2431dc0f64e0f95\" title=\"93-fact-boolean-2\">93-fact-boolean-2</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"ex-subdirectly-irred---Two-Element-Boolean-Algebra-Is-Subdirectly-Irreducible\">ex-subdirectly-irred - Two-Element Boolean Algebra Is Subdirectly Irreducible</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span> is the fully displayed two-element Boolean algebra of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2431dc0f64e0f95\" href=\"?note=e2431dc0f64e0f95\" title=\"93-fact-boolean-2\">93-fact-boolean-2</a>, with congruence set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\Delta_{\\mathbf2},\\nabla_{\\mathbf2}\\}\">\\(\\{\\Delta_{\\mathbf2},\\nabla_{\\mathbf2}\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\\)</span> is the subdirect-irreducibility predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}subdirectly\\text{-}irred}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf2)=\\{\\Delta_{\\mathbf2},\\nabla_{\\mathbf2}\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}subdirectly\\text{-}irred}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf2)=\\{\\Delta_{\\mathbf2},\\nabla_{\\mathbf2}\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The two-element Boolean algebra is nontrivial and simple, so its total\ncongruence is the least non-diagonal congruence.  It therefore supplies a\nfully internal subdirectly irreducible example without relying on an\nundeclared presentation of the alternating group.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-subdirectly-irred---Two-Element-Boolean-Algebra-Is-Subdirectly-Irreducible","text":"ex-subdirectly-irred - Two-Element Boolean Algebra Is Subdirectly Irreducible","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-fact-boolean-2","status":"resolved","id":"e2431dc0f64e0f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-fact-boolean-2]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-fact-boolean-2","status":"resolved","id":"e2431dc0f64e0f95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf2$ is the fully displayed two-element Boolean algebra of [[93-fact-boolean-2]], with congruence set $\\{\\Delta_{\\mathbf2},\\nabla_{\\mathbf2}\\}$.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-boolean-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","sta